		<p>The refrigerant label is located underneath the hood, and states the following information:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>Type of refrigerant</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Amount of refrigerant</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>For more information, refer to <xref href="t00315.dita#t00315"/>.</p>
